Apple today released the fourth public betas of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a>, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipados-27/">iPadOS 27</a>, tvOS 27, and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macos-27/">macOS Golden Gate</a>, allowing anyone with a compatible device to download and test the new software. The fourth betas come a week after Apple seeded the third betas and just a few hours after the sixth developer betas.<br/>
